  id: preset-parry
  displayName: Mirror Guard (Parry / Deflect)
  playstyle: parry
  description: 'Objective: turn accurate defense into offense. Perfect defense stores counter charges (Counter Preparation) and reflects damage (Deflection). Mirror Stance spends a turn for strong reflection + a charge; Riposte cashes charges in (+30% each). Strike is the free fallback, Mend the safety valve.

    Trade-off: needs Perfect defense; charges fade after 2 idle player turns.'
